From: HiBreak Pro Color <hibreak@localhost>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 18:16:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HiBreak Pro Color: Android 16 frameworks/native essentials

Ported from the validated 22.2 baseline; keep the existing kernel/vendor.
E-Ink: cache the render profile (property serial, parse on change), compose active profiles into a scratch surface instead of snapshotting the output buffer, log shader failures once, and write profile properties off the main thread only when they change.
E-Ink: Hyper keeps continuous tone unless the composer reports high-rate content (vendor.xrz.cur_fps >= persist.vendor.xrz.fps_high), like the stock framework; Hyper zeroes text ink, paper white and dark ink.
---

